    <body>
      <div type="clause" n="74">
        <head><ref type="lawCode" target="law:IICn">II Cn</ref> 74</head>
        <ab type="selectedText" xml:lang="und">And ne nyde man næfre naðor ne wif ne mæden to ðam þe hire sylfre mislicige, ne wið sceatte ne sylle, buton he hwæt agenes ðances gyfan wylle.</ab>
        <ab type="translation" xml:lang="en">And no woman or maiden shall every be forced to marry a man whom she dislikes, nor shall she be given for money, except the suitor desires of his own freewill to give something.</ab>
        <ab type="supplementaryText" xml:lang="und">⁊ na nyde man naðer ne wif ne mæden to þam, þe hyre sylfre mislicie, ne wið sceatte ne sylle, butan he hwæt agenes ðances gyfan wylle.</ab>
      </div>
    </body>
